041", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75295893_1122035958805707_3976827415305179869_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tRmD11NUk9wQ7kNvwHmrGp1&_nc_oc=AdqDzyWZc51GTL0kWueHx9mYOwkc-n74qdsE1UHc3nthHW1ZmCEu5Y60yin_j4UNjFs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF5pnhNnJWHmgnKuVrqa6WXLKQOEz5l6WP9nRUDmzF03A&oe=6A8EC641"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_VROO3.png", "id": "285314937333520", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035431_285314940666853_7917901485208087798_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9VNSjudBQi8Q7kNvwFTmMHt&_nc_oc=Adpe7S3k0AAOUGY_LH3Kv2L7G4laFs7NBlMcOScylhdvcovYGFSP7HG9E8CjQhUoRLw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHIvfYj6fC_KEMYJc1gWa7LIqvtiu3kHGMz8_fUoM0-dQ&oe=6A8EEFE6"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_VROO5.png", "id": "381136241036217", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982584_381136244369550_483176816840528973_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sypWxXrnupwQ7kNvwGiALfI&_nc_oc=AdrAk3F9rklnXSyXRLoGE57vfnZCFyOubwT_P-Z0wfXztwW4pYw_wy7-Mt1XoRS5Eig&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQELsmHw41F_Inl8fssju7_h6z4IVJoAjvId3JKv44I-PQ&oe=6A8EC83A"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_VROO6.png", "id": "2169394943393371", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974513_2169394946726704_833013698734162480_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pXKIXjuiOfUQ7kNvwH7rJer&_nc_oc=AdrdYJRVqGyANiNaD4gt-CUNZAOm7vJQhpXxfJAWN1_LS0ERVSan3OvPIQA-eQYiq1Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFBVdEp6cWViz6p0nyp8q1NZM85xNo2y5kFk_YlNoEGVA&oe=6A8ECA0A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover image.png", "id": "1048298189708781", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003240_1048298193042114_5639017989450219791_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MLiq_WLvyB4Q7kNvwEpRoYr&_nc_oc=AdpZOjWQt7jADi-lF4F6whXP0gfX5itSqR6A621F1j6rU8QrwlEB8v8K1frU4AbdJdI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG3RXLX0ekh10Yskg6FQrOzvRd_HsSIT5tczVSsuVw0WQ&oe=6A8EC53D"}, "display_name": "VROO 360", "keywords": [], "long_description": "VROO est une solution cl\u00e9-en-main pour pr\u00e9senter des films 360\u00b0 \u00e0 votre public sur les appareils Meta Quest. Notre agence vous accompagne dans la cr\u00e9ation d\u2019un programme VR parfait pour votre \u00e9v\u00e9nement !\n> S\u00e9lectionnez vos films dans notre catalogue. VROO offre plus de 30 exp\u00e9riences (Fiction, Documentaire, Exp\u00e9rimental, Nature & D\u00e9couverte, Enfants, etc.) ;\n> Lancer l\u2019application et t\u00e9l\u00e9chargez vos films en utilisant un code PIN;\n> Profitez de votre application VROO personnalis\u00e9e : Une interface simple et ergonomique en mode kiosque qui permet \u00e0 vos spectateurs de d\u00e9marrer les films en utilisant leur regard.\n\nPour plus d\u2019informations, contactez notre \u00e9quipe :  hello@diversioncinema.com\n\n\nVROO is a simple solution to showcase 360\u00b0 movies to your audience on Meta Quest devices. Our agency helps you build the perfect VR program for your event!\n> Choose your movies from our catalog. VROO offers more than 30 experiences (Fiction, Documentary, Experimental, Nature & Discovery, Kids, etc.);\n> Launch the application and download your movies using a pin code;\n> Enjoy your personalized VROO app: A simple and ergonomic interface in kiosk mode that allows your spectators to play the movies using their gaze. \nFor more information, contact our team: hello@diversioncinema.com", "short_description": "Pr\u00e9sentez des films 360\u00b0 \u00e0 votre publique en toute simplicit\u00e9 !\nThe easiest way to showcase 360 VR movies to your audience!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vroo.io/Legal-Notice", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name"